dtb = data.table(idx = c(1,2), val = c("a", "b"), key = "idx")

This fails because of cartesian join not allowed by default

dta[dtb, val := i.val]

but this doesn't

dta[dtb, val := i.val, nomatch = 0]

This is the same as doing

dta[dtb, val := i.val, allow.cartesian = TRUE]

